         </dc:creator>
         <dc:subject>
            <rdf:Bag>
               <rdf:li>First results from NASA's Magnetospheric Multiscale (MMS) Mission; IONOSPHERE: Electric fields; MAGNETOSPHERIC PHYSICS: Magnetic reconnection, Electric fields, Magnetopause and boundary layers; SOLAR PHYSICS, ASTROPHYSICS, AND ASTRONOMY: Magnetic reconnection; SPACE PLASMA PHYSICS: Magnetic reconnection, Particle acceleration, Spacecraft sheaths, wakes, charging</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Bag>
